+- scrapework fed canStreamWithoutBody cb.SizeBytes(), the allocated capacity
+  (chunks * 4096), where the maxScrapeSize check uses cb.Len(), the bytes read.
+  Below a 4096-byte minResponseSizeForStreamParse the two paths disagreed about
+  the same response. It uses Len now.
+
+- -zstd.encoderConcurrency was declared only under !cgo, while the release
+  vmagent is built with CGO_ENABLED=1, where passing it aborts start-up with
+  "flag provided but not defined". It is declared for both builds and ignored
+  by the cgo path, which compresses through gozstd and has no such pool.
