+++Also adds tests recording what happens across a scrape outage longer than
+++staleness_interval: once the aggregator has forgotten an input, it counts
+++the whole cumulative value present at recovery. With every pod out, the
+++emitted zero causes double counting; with a single pod out, it is counted
+++twice whether or not the zero is emitted. All three cases add up correctly
+++when the target reports only the never-delivered increment under a new
